    [CI] start single-node tests in parallel once multi-node pods are ready (#19690)
    
    ### What this PR does / why we need it?
    
    Currently the A2 nightly single-node and accuracy jobs wait for the
    entire
    `multi-node-tests` job (including the long Stream logs phase) to finish
    before
    starting, which serializes independent workloads and wastes time. This
    change
    adds an A2-only readiness gate so single-node / accuracy tests start as
    soon as
    the multi-node pods are launched, while the multi-node test keeps
    running in the
    background.
    
    ### Does this PR introduce _any_ user-facing change?
    
    No
    
    ### How was this patch tested?
    
    by running test cases
    
